  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 711.27 General System Evaluation Nitrite Samples",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 711.27 General System Evaluation Nitrite Samples. Any nitrite sample collected in addition to the routine or confirmation samples for a PWS shall be used to determine compliance if the sample:\n\n(a) Is representative of water being supplied to consumers; and\n\n(b) Exceeds the MCL for nitrite as specified in Env-Dw 704.02.\n\nSource. #9700, eff 5-1-10; ss by #12668, eff 1-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
